  <summary date="2026-10-14T18:05:10Z" status="Introduced in Senate">Judicial Ethics Enforcement Act of 2026

This bill establishes the Office of Inspector General for the Judicial Branch to investigate alleged misconduct in the judicial branch, including the Supreme Court; to conduct and supervise audits and investigations; and to prevent and detect waste, fraud, and abuse.</summary>
